nd protect the kingdom together."},"used_in":[{"tip":"Total War","cat":"pvp","banner":"TOTALWAR.webp"},{"tip":"Guild War","cat":"pvp","banner":"GUILDWAR.webp"}],"lore":"Rook is a mighty and silent lion beastkin.\nAs a beastkin, he is stronger and nimbler than the average human. He can run across castle walls faster than any other soldier, even in heavy armor.\n Rook is stubborn and prioritizes following orders and protecting his position at all costs. Many of his fellow soldiers jokingly refer to him as the castle golem.\nHe is a fierce advocate for equality between humans and beastkin, and he works tirelessly to create a world free of discrimination.\nRook believes strongly in leading by example, preferring to let his achievements and love of his country and family prove that he is the same as any human."}